From: OpenMandriva
Subject: [PATCH] Fall back to F16 when ggml has no native FP8 types

leejet/ggml 841 adds GGML_TYPE_F8_E4M3 / F8_E5M2 for backend-native
FP8 matmul. Distro ggml 0.22 has neither type. Restore the 820
F8-to-F16 load path unless those enums exist.

